# The context is packages/browseros-agent. Send only what Cargo needs to load the workspace and
# build the server: every member's manifest and sources (Cargo refuses a member it cannot read),
# the lockfile, and this folder. node_modules alone is about 2 GB.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!apps/claw-server
**/node_modules
# Only Cargo's output at the root: `**/target` would also drop source modules such as
# browseros-core/src/target/.
target
